Accordingly, I pass the following:
ORDER i) The appeal is allowed-in-part;
- 11 - NC: 2024:KHC:1938 ii) The judgment and award dated 11.10.2019 passed by Additional Small Causes Judge and Motor Accident Claims Tribunal, Bengaluru in MVC.No.3940/2018 is modified;
iii) The claimants would be entitled to a sum of Rs.27,29,000/- as against Rs.13,66,000/- with interest @ 6% per annum from the date of petition till realization;
iv) The enhanced compensation amount shall be paid by the respondent within a period of six weeks from the date of receipt of a copy of this order;
v) Out of the compensation awarded herein, 40% of the compensation award amount to the share of claimant No.2 shall be invested in a fixed deposit in Nationalized Bank, till the attainment and majority of the minor child and remaining amount to the share of claimant Nos.1, 3 and 4 shall be released in their favour upon proper verification, with liberty to claimant No.1, the mother of claimant No.2 to withdraw the interest from out of - 12 - NC: 2024:KHC:1938 the deposited amount in the fixed deposit to be utilized for the benefit of the minor child.
Sd/-
